"spoiler":false,"text":"晴れて正宗と付き合うことになった郁子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"唯一の不満は、正宗があまりベタベタしてくれないこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな思いからか二人でラブラブデートする夢を見る健気な郁子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところが、夢はどんどんおかしな展開に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翌日、その内容を正宗やクラスメイト達に話す郁子だったが、なんと……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトの少女。主人公とは席が隣同士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供っぽさに満ちた天然系少女。無邪気で明るく能天気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかもお人好し。忘れっぽかったり、すぐ虚勢を張ったりと、なにかとお子様である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"”ピタゴラドジっ子”で、コケル→手からリンゴが飛んでいく→バケツにホールインワン→重みでシーソーが傾き鉢植えが転がり落ちる…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最終的には何故か水の入ったバケツが本人の頭の上に降ってくるという奇跡の連携がよく発生する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「郁子、アルバイトの時間なので行きますね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53591"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53591","value":"ジェリービーンズetc、飴"},{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53591","value":"1-2"},{"label":"苦手なもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53591","value":"英語、オバケ"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53591","value":"ペットの世話、変なブログ"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15603","sourceWorkId":"14277","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/te